!content/videos/_inbox/README.md
content/videos/*/frames/
content/videos/*/source/*.wav
content/videos/*/source/reference.mp4
content/videos/*/build/
content/videos/*/qa/
content/videos/studio/out/

# Foundations working audio chunks
content/videos/*/source/chunk_*.mp3
content/videos/*/source/narration_master_parts/

